WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.636 line:0%
Today's<i> Sandy Speaks</i> is going
to focus directly

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:04.837
<i> on my white people.</i>

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:06.105
<i> But what I need you
 to understand</i>

00:00:06.538 --> 00:00:10.176
is that being a black person
in America is very, very hard.

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:12.678
OFFICER BRIAN ENCINIA:
I will light you up! Get out!

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:14.147
-SANDRA BLAND: Wow.
-Now!

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.549
SHANTE NEEDHAM:
<i> Sandy called me,</i>

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.252 line:0%
let me know
that she had been arrested.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:20.986
<i> How do you go from...</i>

00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:23.623
SHARON COOPER:<i> ...failure
 to signal a lane change...</i>

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.026
SHANTE:<i>  ...to dead in jail
 by alleged suicide?</i>

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.363 line:0%
GENEVA REED-VEAL:
<i> I believe she let them know,
 "I'll see you guys in court,"</i>

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:31.397
and I believe they silenced her.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.866
R. GLENN SMITH:<i> Do I think
 this jail had anything</i>

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.835
<i> to do with her death?
 No.</i>

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.405 line:0%
But moral responsibility-wise?

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:39.838
<i> Absolutely.</i>

00:00:40.572 --> 00:00:42.241 line:0%
-PROTESTERS:<i> Sandra Bland!</i>
