00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:43.876
-PROTESTERS:<i> Sandra Bland!</i>
-CHANT LEADER:<i> Say her name!</i>

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:45.978
-PROTESTERS:<i> Sandra Bland!</i>
-CHANT LEADER:<i> Say her name!</i>

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.947
ALL:<i> Say her name! Say her name!</i>

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.749
<i> Say her name! Say her name!</i>

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:50.916 line:0%
<i> Say her name!</i>

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.554 line:0%
